  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act9mini_level_act9mini_st04",
  "groupId": "act9mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "隻影孤身",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9mini/level_act9mini_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4598cfd7a447455710f4ce3a728ba9b6222d2e57c47e0669fea5f90319b939ac",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔1.5-7"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟殺手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有腳印，沒有人通過的痕跡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟殺手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們沒有從這方向走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟領隊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫院的小隊弄丟了目標，這些人想逃脫必然要經過這周邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟領隊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保持警惕，隨時彙報情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟殺手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟殺手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟殺手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟殺手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃、 啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們很快就會發現這裡的異常，趁現在，快跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還輪不到你來指揮我，感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能從那個距離如此輕鬆地解決掉這群下賤的東西，我是得承認你有些實力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是別搞錯了，這不代表我就要聽從你的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一帶，都被無胄盟的人包圍，你一個人很難逃出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們會一直追著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那又如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會叫他們為自己的愚蠢後悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......很難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的傷還沒好，現在想要躲過他們的耳目會很難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......該死的無胄盟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我答應和你們合作，但是記住，這只是因為我們有同一個對手。我要讓那些下賤的兇手為他們的行為付出代價！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些之後再談，我們現在還沒完全脫困。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不覺得我和你們還有什麼更多好談的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姑娘，感謝那個提出荒唐要求的冠軍吧，若非如此，你不會有穿上這身甲胄在這裡和我說話的一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說的對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我曾經，非常感謝血騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，這就說不出話來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......比賽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看過你和瑪莉婭·臨光的對決——“塑膠”瑟奇亞克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不喜歡你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在賽場上，比現在要稍微不那麼討厭一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的心情無關緊要，但注意你的態度。既然是這樣，你就不該將我從醫院帶出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索娜覺得有必要這麼做。況且——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且什麼。索娜，這就是你們頭領的名字？哼，聽起來又是個小姑娘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......索娜是夥伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們現在回據點，索娜和其他夥伴都在等我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別因為我暫時同意聯手，就把我和你們混為一談，感染者騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......我不會弄混，你和我們都不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，“塑膠”瑟奇亞克，你自己應該也清楚，你沒辦法獨自對抗無胄盟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......沒錯，你說得不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是可笑，現在的這個卡西米爾，就連感染者都能被稱作騎士，無胄盟一群在陰溝中作祟的小人竟也能滿地橫行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可笑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......先和其他人會合吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勢單力薄，我們什麼都做不成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "十天前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們不是平民，你們到底是什麼人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒完沒了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "混在人群裡是想要偷襲嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別太小看我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等！先別動手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊呀，我是不是來得晚了一點，怎麼已經變成大混戰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好辦了，這下可不好辦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別磨蹭了，事已至此，只能先把人帶走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也只能這樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下午好，“遠牙”騎士，我還沒恭喜你成功拿到騎士封號呢，這可是大好事呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到關於你的報導了，人氣高漲，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宣佈要建立獨立騎士團，爭議連連，人氣高漲？哼，結果就是惹來這群蠅蟲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者騎士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少囉嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行吧，反正打都打了，已經被他們抓到把柄了，唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "焰尾，還有灰毫......你們為什麼會出現在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們知道這群人的來歷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一清二楚。不過這裡不適合站著聊天......這些傢伙想把事情鬧大，一會兒肯定就有報社的人要來了，這對你沒好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，你應該是受傷了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果信得過我們，就先跟我們一起走，之後我們慢慢說明情況，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索娜，這套話你說出來像是在誘拐別人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們要去哪，帶我一起去吧。我信你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們和我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們都是一樣的。我信你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G10"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！你出來得好快，傷口已經處理好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的這些人，他們都是感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯哦。住在這的大家都是感染者，大部分都是因為各種事故不走運地染病，丟了工作丟了家，無處可去的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然這裡吃住都還簡陋了點啦......但有總比沒有好，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索娜，艾沃娜那邊出了點問題，我先過去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無胄盟應該還會有所行動，最近我會讓其他人也都小心點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我清楚。放心，有我看著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。交給你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？啊，你說小灰啊，她是個不錯的傢伙，就是說話有的時候太一板一眼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從見面到現在，她沒有和我說過話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈......可能是小灰她有點認生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（歎氣）哎，好吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實是小灰她總覺得你和我們不太一樣，可能和我們不會是一路的啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，你可是這次特錦賽的明星選手，剛拿到了騎士封號，炙手可熱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼看都前途一片大好嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者......感染者騎士，不會有什麼大好前途。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可不像是剛贏了比賽的人說出來的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本來以為既然還有機會能夠成為騎士，就還有希望。如果能贏比賽，或許......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許還能贏得尊敬，真的被看作是個騎士，贏回過去的生活？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我這麼想過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這是不可能的。感染者騎士依然是感染者，沒什麼不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。我就是這麼和小灰說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且——就算是騎士又怎麼樣呢？看看混在人群裡襲擊你的那些人，他們可不管你是感染者騎士，還是貴族騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些人，就是你說的無胄盟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士殺手......令人討厭的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，就是他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為商業聯合會賣命，暗地裡解決掉那些不聽話的騎士......他們自稱是對付騎士的專家，對此還頗感自豪呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是，在觀眾們的歡呼和打賞面前，就算是正經騎士，又留著多少尊嚴？更何況是我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次襲擊我，也是商業聯合會的指示？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該是了。你的表現太耀眼，又不肯加入找上門來的那些騎士團，還說出那種宣言......這些人遲早會找上門來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你既然不肯變成他們的搖錢樹，那就只好讓你“不名譽”地退場，免得妨礙商機了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如何，因為這種原因被襲擊，是不是覺得很荒唐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......兩個三周。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在來大騎士領的路上，我不小心感染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為是感染者，所以被拒絕註冊成為騎士，又因為沒有旅店可以住，而在邊緣地塊徘徊了三周。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第三周的時候，血騎士贏了那一屆的特錦賽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又過了三周，面向感染者的騎士註冊窗口正式建立並且對外開放了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個時候，我身上已經沒剩下什麼錢，所以我去了黑市的擂台，才終於湊夠了註冊需要的手續費。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那還真是......不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者騎士的地下競技場，和黑市也差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從地下競技場到特錦賽，我見過太多荒唐的事，已經不會因此而吃驚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，你說得沒錯......地下競技場裡比無胄盟還離譜的事情可太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是因為大家或多或少都經歷過這些，所以現在我們才會像這樣聚集在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這裡還有很多普通感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......該怎麼說呢，騎士競賽還是能賺到不少的，至少足夠買下這些無處可去的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼一來，這些錢也還算有點價值，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的性格比我們之前想的要好相處不少......最開始和你搭上話的時候，還真以為你人很冷酷呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，怎麼又不說話了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種時候應該說什麼，我不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧......至少我現在明白了，你和小灰都挺認生的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有你這個先說半截的說話習慣，我也差不多習慣了。嗯，除了偶爾有點難理解以外，也沒什麼不好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不管怎麼說，謝謝你們這次幫我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡哪裡，不用這麼客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，接下來你準備去哪？要是立刻復出，很可能再次被那些人盯上哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒准很快今天的事件就要上報了，猜猜看，他們會把新聞寫成什麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不知道。隨他們吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......不知道該去哪。我早就沒地方可去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說，或許有點挾恩圖報的嫌疑......不過這可不是一時心血來潮，我發誓我早就想這麼做了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和小灰，還有艾沃娜，你也見過的，就是那個嗓門很大的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，我記得她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實......關於你之前對外宣佈要建獨立騎士團的事，我們也有相同的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "名字是我起的，我們叫它紅松，紅松騎士團，我們自己的騎士團。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果沒有其他地方可以去的話，查絲汀娜，要不要考慮一下，加入我們，和我們一起走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是在......邀請我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......確定嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，難道我說得還不夠直接？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "紅松騎士團......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。我加入你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我們......一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到這裡應該就沒問題了，前面會有人接應，我們安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的傷還好嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼問題，這點小傷不值一提。倒是你們感染者騎士，你們的據點居然在城市內部，而不是邊緣或是村莊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒人會容許感染者生活在這座城市裡——你們耍了什麼花招？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有花招。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要有錢，沒有那麼難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，錢......說的不錯，只要有錢，在這個地方什麼都不難辦到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但凡走露風聲，你們就全都會因為違法而被捕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在有人說出什麼不該說的之前，我的箭會解決他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不允許任何人危害到紅松騎士團。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就快替我指路吧，只要想到那些無胄盟的渣滓還在外逍遙，我就一刻也無法忍受。既然決定要和商業聯合會作對，就動作越快越好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我去見見你們那個能讓有你這樣實力的感染者騎士違背自身意願，將我帶出醫院的感染者騎士領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不算違背。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救出塑膠騎士這個任務，不是索娜要求，是我自己主動要去的。這並不違背我的個人意願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎麼回事，我以為我們雙方都不對彼此有任何好感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是說，你要告訴我這是一種顧全大局？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是......你有家人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼意思......難道說？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這群螻蟻，他們竟敢對那孩子動手？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用擔心，索娜讓人一直盯著。無胄盟的殺手已經撤退了，他們沒有對你的兒子怎麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會為此道謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對索娜說吧。全都是她在安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於我，我不希望看到你出事和我是否欣賞你個人無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是，看到你的兒子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果沒有你，那個男孩就無家可歸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士查絲汀娜有家鄉，有期盼她的親人，朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這不屬於感染者查絲汀娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......感染者無處可去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不僅是感染者，在這裡，很多人都沒有歸處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經回不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果風真的能把我的聲音帶回去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就請閉口不言，除了口笛的旋律，什麼也別說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓查絲汀娜仍然是個簡單的，平凡的......做著騎士美夢的女孩吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
